{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hey, you. You're finally awake. It's time to get up, put on your clothes, eat a bowl of sugary cereal, head out the door. You've just started working at the nearest DESTROYER BURGER, America's favorite fast food restaurant.\u00a0Destroyer Burger is a fast-paced first-person fast food chaos simulator about multitasking, bad decisions, and corporate despair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/328b45fcad8ff7104709dfd826c17985.avif?t=1768512128\" width=776 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/30f27192b1c6458edeb7deb036a3f17e.poster.avif?t=1768512128\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/30f27192b1c6458edeb7deb036a3f17e.webm?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/30f27192b1c6458edeb7deb036a3f17e.mp4?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle multiple customers, learn meal combinations and kick out the most troublesome patrons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your stocks high: prepare fries in advance, always fill up the grill, and be ready for anything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, the worst is yet to come. Struggle through the intensive rush hours when people overrun your little restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/ef2e2f7fd9b0f23b4177bbe3417cfc5c.avif?t=1768512128\" width=776 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/2b0f7ffba0269f545724403bdda91784.poster.avif?t=1768512128\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/2b0f7ffba0269f545724403bdda91784.webm?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/2b0f7ffba0269f545724403bdda91784.mp4?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playthrough with over 30 different perks that improve your abilities to create meals from frozen slop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy affordable crappy Norwegian furniture to stave off the inevitable existential crisis of working in fast food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the pain with various medical supplies to improve your chances at victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/0be2968dc51cb898200136c19c5317eb.avif?t=1768512128\" width=776 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/d3c37b6d943b8f082b1f3886a3f121d6.poster.avif?t=1768512128\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/d3c37b6d943b8f082b1f3886a3f121d6.webm?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/d3c37b6d943b8f082b1f3886a3f121d6.mp4?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a replayable main campaign with multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also included: an advanced longer campaign and a randomizer mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a super-secret ending which you won't even know to look for unless you read this description ;3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/e988016e856d12ce2946c3e841e443e3.avif?t=1768512128\" width=776 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>juuf1n:</strong>   <br>Now if someone still hasn\u2019t wishlisted this game yet, then by all means go wishlist Destroyer Burger. This is an absolutely top-tier game. I promise.<br><br><strong>Apripsykoosi:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I feel like someone's been smacking my buns with a spatula. 10/10 would flip my sh*t again.<br><br><strong>kosminenkaaos:</strong>   <br>This game brought about my 'Nam flashbacks. And that's quite the feat because I'm a millennial. 6/5 would recommend for anyone.<br> <br><strong>maerikaroliina:</strong>   <br>Easy and fun.  <br> <br><strong>veranthia:</strong>   <br>Destroyer Burger is hectic fun! The satire doesn\u2019t hold itself back, and the gameplay doesn\u2019t leave you cold. Strong recommendation!  <br> <br><strong>snihy:</strong>  <br>This is really fun, it\u2019s addictive. Stressful, but still fun \u2014 not too stressful.  <br> <br><strong>TheAsgaard:</strong>  <br>It\u2019s fun, it\u2019s enjoyable, it\u2019s challenging.  <br> <br><strong>lakoninen:</strong>   <br>Destroyer Burger hilariously combines the chaos behind a fast-food counter with the journey home after a brutal workday. The game has more layers than Mallie\u2019s monster burger. Big recommendation! <br> <br><strong>kiskoo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is UNIQUE in many ways. You\u2019ll be stressed out as hell but you\u2019ll wake up tomorrow wanting to flip some more patties. Honorary mention to the depression system and all the never ending references, you\u2019ll have a good laugh! Ps. Please remember to oil them grills\u2026<br><br><strong>MedicFinland:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroyer Burger will pump up your blood and destroy your fate in your organizing skills. It will make you feel like you are nothing against this corporate junk food manufacturing machine. 10/10 would play again to up my blood pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/a9bdb6bdaccd51791ba449a0ae30df38.avif?t=1768512128\" width=776 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/634ccade7309bb45f471a5fe1eb2817e.poster.avif?t=1768512128\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/634ccade7309bb45f471a5fe1eb2817e.webm?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/634ccade7309bb45f471a5fe1eb2817e.mp4?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple gameplay modes with escalating difficulty and systemic chaos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 3D acceleration technology (warning: requires a GPU).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress with a revolutionary new feature called \u201csave your game\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be able to quit the game without pressing Alt+F4.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possibly the only game on Steam that has earnable achievements (we didn't check).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/c00936d0569198aa4a5cd6d843aa6e41.avif?t=1768512128\" width=776 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/94b8e93b248b1f68f9fa784f8340ce50.poster.avif?t=1768512128\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/94b8e93b248b1f68f9fa784f8340ce50.webm?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/94b8e93b248b1f68f9fa784f8340ce50.mp4?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3261200?t=1768512128","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768512128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/23fe3427f3b5e50dbf047e98