l combinations and kick out the most troublesome patrons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your stocks high: prepare fries in advance, always fill up the grill, and be ready for anything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, the worst is yet to come. Struggle through the intensive rush hours when people overrun your little restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/ef2e2f7fd9b0f23b4177bbe3417cfc5c.avif?t=1768512128\" width=776 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/2b0f7ffba0269f545724403bdda91784.poster.avif?t=1768512128\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/2b0f7ffba0269f545724403bdda91784.webm?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261200/extras/2b0f7ffba0269f545724403bdda91784.mp4?t=1768512128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playthrough with over 30 different perks that improve your abilities to create meals from frozen slop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy affordable crappy Norwegian furniture to stave off the inevitable existential crisis of working in fast food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the pain with various medical supplies to improve your chances at victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >